     Comment "Annex crime site sign crime_car, Title section."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{D08CA63D553D021D}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_CrimeCar_What"
     Target_en_us "A pile of tyres that stands in for a car theft."
     Comment "Annex crime site sign crime_car, What section."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{04CA2A9741FCE1E2}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_CrimeCar_How"
     Target_en_us "Stand at the pile and use Steal the vehicle to get an armoured car. It rests for 10 minutes."
     Comment "Annex crime site sign crime_car, How section."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{7708887CAD318B12}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_CrimeCar_Needs"
     Target_en_us "A civilian. No police need to be online here."
     Comment "Annex crime site sign crime_car, Needs section."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{A7B60EDD94E30F9D}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_CrimeCar_Rules"
     Target_en_us "Theft of a vehicle is reported and raises your wanted level."
     Comment "Annex crime site sign crime_car, Rules section."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{5300C9F183BC88B6}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_CrimeCar_Next"
     Target_en_us "Finish at the police desk: a wanted suspect and a table of evidence."
     Comment "Annex crime site sign crime_car, Next section."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{42F8C061DF3563D6}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_CrimePolice_Title"
     Target_en_us "4. Police desk"
     Comment "Annex crime site sign crime_police, Title section."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{3DC7AE65EB4CA435}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_CrimePolice_What"
     Target_en_us "A practice desk with an ID card and a confiscated key. Real duty is at the police station."
     Comment "Annex crime site sign crime_police, What section."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{62D77C89BF0EB242}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_CrimePolice_How"
     Target_en_us "Look the table over. For real duty, evidence and the wanted board, walk to the police station on the main street."
     Comment "Annex crime site sign crime_police, How section."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{E0A442EE0FE38171}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_CrimePolice_Needs"
     Target_en_us "Nothing here."
     Comment "Annex crime site sign crime_police, Needs section."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{734524B72ED94D31}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_CrimePolice_Next"
     Target_en_us "Clock on at the police station to arrest the suspect you made."
     Comment "Annex crime site sign crime_police, Next section."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{D8F9FC9FD0EEAC13}" {
     Id "LF-PoliceApp_Title"
     Target_en_us "Application to the Everon Police"
     Comment "Police application form title."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{6F65DE9EB00006ED}" {
     Id "LF-CharSel_Title"
     Target_en_us "Civil Registry of Everon, Residents on File"
     Comment "Character pick title on arrival, shown when an account may hold more than one character. A 1989 registry sheet."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{156BE656616C6972}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_LotPrice_Title"
     Target_en_us "%1 %2"
     Comment "Price board title at the vehicle lot (#540): %1 is the car name, %2 the price read from the lot's price list in config."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{F7B900AAB3964016}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_DebugJail_Title"
     Target_en_us "Playtest: jail board"
     Comment "Title of the debug board by the jail entrance."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{66031F4E19D748E0}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_DebugJail_What"
     Target_en_us "Playtest only. Use the action on this board to be jailed for 60 seconds through the real jail path, so you can try the cell, the visit window and the release alone."
     Comment "Body of the debug jail board."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{1C23DAF5E8974D14}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_DebugJail_Next"
     Target_en_us "Wait out the 60 seconds, or try a breakout. The cell, the visit window and the release are the real ones."
     Comment "Next-step line of the debug jail board."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{BD4EFB2082D27D79}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Clerk_Done"
     Target_en_us "Welcome to Everon. Here is something to start you off. The town is yours now. The shops, the car lot, the police station and the organization office are all on the town board."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the clerk NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{1A14D27D9FCB619D}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_Clerk_AboutTown"
     Target_en_us "Everon is a small island. People here know each other, and they remember faces. Stay honest and you will do well."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the clerk NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue clerk"
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{296D485ED962E190}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_PoliceCases_Title"
     Target_en_us "Case board"
     Comment "Sign Read card title for the police case board (#148)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{9CB43F394C2650F6}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_PoliceCases_What"
     Target_en_us "Open cases, one column each: the crime, where and when, the suspect, and the evidence pinned against it."
     Comment "Case board Read card (#148)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{F33E84A46C3A3659}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_PoliceCases_How"
     Target_en_us "Bag what a scene left (casings, footprint cards, dropped items, witness statements), then Pin evidence here. Unpin takes down the last card."
     Comment "Case board Read card (#148)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{FCBCE38D272C85F0}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_PoliceCases_Rules"
     Target_en_us "On-duty police only. A case closes when the suspect is no longer wanted."
     Comment "Case board Read card (#148)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{2306825FF804F997}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_PoliceCases_Next"
     Target_en_us "The evidence locker keeps every logged bag; the wanted board shows the suspects to the public."
     Comment "Case board Read card (#148)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{EE39881CFABC1E92}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_TestOrg_Title"
     Target_en_us "Test organisation"
     Comment "Title of the playtest organisation sign (#934)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{0D48BB18722E316D}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_TestOrg_What"
     Target_en_us "Playtest only: a shared organisation for one tester."
     Comment "Sign card of the playtest organisation sign (#934)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{DFA15542C4155B52}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_TestOrg_How"
     Target_en_us "Use Join test organisation. The first one in founds it and takes the hideout yard. Use Leave organisation to get out again."
     Comment "Sign card of the playtest organisation sign (#934)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{C4E999C65CA365AF}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_TestOrg_Needs"
     Target_en_us "Nothing. This sign works in the playtest town only."
     Comment "Sign card of the playtest organisation sign (#934)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{39447CA62CCE01E3}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_TestOrg_Next"
     Target_en_us "The hideout door is at the end of the cobbled alley: members open it, everyone else is told whose it is."
     Comment "Sign card of the playtest organisation sign (#934)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{FBE2A53D441A63D5}" {
     Id "LF-NpcRole_ranger_What"
     Target_en_us "I teach people to survive outside town. Water, food, a fire, a shelter. The weather turns fast on Everon."
     Comment "NPC role talk (ranger), from tools/assets/outfits/roles.json."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{06F11B7C90FB5AF0}" {
     Id "LF-Sign_BlackMarket_Rules"
     Target_en_us "Police can search it. After a search the room stays shut for about ten minutes."
     Comment "Sign card of the back room: the one thing that closes it (#933)."
    }
    CustomStringTableItem "{4E29407E130F00C3}" {
     Id "LF-Dialogue_FuelClerk_AboutWhere"
     Target_en_us "This is Everon, friend. One road around the coast, and this is the only fuel in town. Petrol at the pumps, oil and maps in here. The square is just up the street."
     Comment "Dialogue caption, spoken by the fuel_clerk NPC (voiced; tools/assets/dialogue/fuel_clerk). Changing it needs: tools\\cli asset dialogue fuel_clerk"
    }
 }
